\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. O Jesus, we are well and strong,
\par And we can run about and play;
\par But there are children who are sick,
\par And have to lie all day.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. We thank Thee for our health and strength;
\par And, loving Lord, we pray Thee bless
\par The children who are weak and ill
\par And suffer pain and weariness.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Lord, give us thoughtful, loving hearts,
\par Show us kind deeds which may be done
\par By us, for Jesu's sake, to help
\par Some sad or suffering little one.
\par Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

